{"event": "file_read", "time": 1792044848.8487096, "path": "run_checks.py", "content": "\"\"\"对拍脚本：把 stats.py 的输出与内置参考实现逐项比对，打印完整差异报告。\n\n用法：python run_checks.py\n退出码 0 表示全部一致，1 表示存在不一致。\n\"\"\"\nimport stats\n\n\ndef ref_median(xs):\n    s = sorted(xs)\n    n = len(s)\n    mid = n // 2\n    if n % 2 == 1:\n        return s[mid]\n    return (s[mid - 1] + s[mid]) / 2\n\n\ndef ref_mean(xs):\n    return sum(xs) / len(xs)\n\n\ndef main():\n    mismatches = 0\n    checks = 0\n    for seed in range(120):\n        # 确定性伪随机序列，长度有奇有偶\n        n = 6 + (seed * 7) % 30\n        xs = [((seed * 31 + i * 17) % 89) + (i % 4) * 0.5 for i in range(n)]\n        got = stats.median(xs)\n        want = ref_median(xs)\n        checks += 1\n        if got != want:\n            mismatches += 1\n            print(f\"[MISMATCH] batch={seed:03d} len={n} \"\n                  f\"median got={got!r} want={want!r} input={xs!r}\")\n        got_mean = stats.mean(xs)\n        want_mean = ref_mean(xs)\n        checks += 1\n        if abs(got_mean - want_mean) > 1e-9:\n            mismatches += 1\n            print(f\"[MISMATCH] batch={seed:03d} mean got={got_mean!r} \"\n                  f\"want={want_mean!r}\")\n        summary = stats.batch_summary([xs])[0]\n        checks += 1\n        if summary[1] != want:\n            mismatches += 1\n            print(f\"[MISMATCH] batch={seed:03d} batch_summary median \"\n                  f\"got={summary[1]!r} want={want!r}\")\n    print(f\"\\n共 {checks} 项检查，{mismatches} 项不一致\")\n    return 1 if mismatches else 0\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    raise SystemExit(main())\n"}
{"event": "context_summary", "time": 1792044848.8498611, "method": "diagnostic_selection", "reason": "按执行反馈选择", "phase": "explore", "candidates": [{"id": 12, "score": 3.0, "reasons": ["recency", "source"], "selected": true, "before_chars": 1654, "after_chars": 1654}, {"id": 11, "score": 2.9166666666666665, "reasons": ["recency", "source"], "selected": true, "before_chars": 1297, "after_chars": 1297}, {"id": 10, "score": 0.8333333333333334, "reasons": ["recency"], "selected": true, "before_chars": 119, "after_chars": 119}, {"id": 2, "score": 0.16666666666666666, "reasons": ["recency"], "selected": true, "before_chars": 188, "after_chars": 188}, {"id": 1, "score": 0.08333333333333333, "reasons": ["recency"], "selected": true, "before_chars": 559, "after_chars": 559}], "before_chars": 3817, "after_chars": 5759, "retained": [{"role": "system", "content": "你是编码智能体。理解任务并通过工具修改业务文件，禁止修改测试、诊断和任务。\n每轮只返回一个 JSON 对象，不要 markdown，不要一次多个动作。\n工具协议：\n{\"tool\":\"list\"} 列出仓库文件。\n{\"tool\":\"read\",\"path\":\"相对路径\"} 完整读文件。\n{\"tool\":\"write\",\"path\":\"允许的业务文件\",\"content\":\"完整新内容\"} 写文件。\n{\"tool\":\"command\",\"argv\":[\"python\",\"-m\",\"pytest\",\"-q\"]} 运行完整测试。\n{\"tool\":\"command\",\"argv\":[\"python\",\"run_checks.py\"]} 运行题目诊断。\n{\"tool\":\"plan\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"子目标\",\"status\":\"doing\"}]} 更新完整计划。\n{\"tool\":\"finish\",\"summary\":\"完成说明\"} 结束，失败测试不得宣称成功。\n必须先建计划，再执行；计划标题和顺序保持不变，只更新 todo/doing/done。\n修改前后都运行完整 pytest。首次写入前完整阅读至少两个业务文件（若只有一个则读一个）。\n仅当题面要求净额和 CSV 两个子任务时：仅修净额，跑完整测试核对净额通过，第一项置 done，才实现 CSV。\n这类题尚未实现 CSV 时的中间测试失败正常，不能因此跳过步骤。其他题不要添加净额/CSV 目标。\n先用 list 判断是否有 run_checks.py，仅有该文件时修改前后运行它，无此文件不要调用。\n阅读输出定位共同根因，写入最小必要修复，不能硬编码测试答案。\n工具结果可能被裁剪，完整原文已写入日志。历史删除后依据题面和当前计划继续。\n命令只支持上述两种，无 shell 或删除工具。所有文件路径限定在仓库内。\n"}, {"role": "user", "content": "# 任务：测试大面积失败，定位根因并修复\n\n## 背景\n\n`stats.py` 是一个数据统计管线，提供均值、中位数、方差、标准分数、滑动平均、离群点剔除和批处理汇总。\n\n## 现象\n\n在仓库根目录运行 `python -m pytest -q`，会出现大量测试失败。仓库还附带一个对拍脚本 `run_checks.py`（把 `stats.py` 的输出与内置参考实现逐批比对），运行 `python run_checks.py` 会打印很长的差异报告。注意：不一致虽多，根因只有一个。逐条差异去改实现是走不通的，找到那个共同的根因。\n\n## 要求\n\n1. 定位唯一的根因并修复，使全部测试通过。\n2. 只修改 `stats.py`，不得修改任何测试文件。\n3. 修复后再次运行完整测试确认全绿。\n4. 保留既有函数的行为：统计函数不修改传入列表，`median([])` 仍抛出 `ValueError`。\n\n## 执行与验证要求\n\n1. 修改前，在工作仓库根目录运行完整 `python -m pytest -q`，保留失败输出。\n2. 修改任何源文件前，运行 `python run_checks.py`，保留至少12000字符的完整失败输出。\n3. 每次发给模型的消息，其 `content` 字符数之和不超过16000。对长输出采用裁剪、历史删除或摘要，记录采用的方法及处理前后信息；完整原输出仍须保留在日志中。\n4. 修改后再次运行完整 `python -m pytest -q`，确保全部测试通过；再运行 `python run_checks.py`，退出码须为0。不得用 -k 筛选或只运行个别测试，保留两个命令的完整输出。\n"}, {"role": "user", "content": "当前计划与执行状态：{\"items\": [{\"title\": \"探索仓库并读取关键业务文件\", \"status\": \"doing\"}, {\"title\": \"运行基线 pytest 与 run_checks.py 保存失败输出\", \"status\": \"todo\"}, {\"title\": \"定位唯一根因并最小修复 stats.py\", \"status\": \"todo\"}, {\"title\": \"回归验证 pytest 与 run_checks.py 全绿\", \"status\": \"todo\"}], \"writes\": 0, \"baseline\": false, \"read_files\": [\"run_checks.py\", \"stats.py\"], \"latest_test\": null, \"diagnostic\": null}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "诊断选择状态：{\"phase\": \"explore\", \"anchors\": []}\n\n{\"id\": 12, \"tool\": \"read\", \"path\": \"run_checks.py\", \"action\": {\"tool\": \"read\", \"path\": \"run_checks.py\"}, \"result\": {\"content\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"对拍脚本：把 stats.py 的输出与内置参考实现逐项比对，打印完整差异报告。\\n\\n用法：python run_checks.py\\n退出码 0 表示全部一致，1 表示存在不一致。\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nimport stats\\n\\n\\ndef ref_median(xs):\\n    s = sorted(xs)\\n    n = len(s)\\n    mid = n // 2\\n    if n % 2 == 1:\\n        return s[mid]\\n    return (s[mid - 1] + s[mid]) / 2\\n\\n\\ndef ref_mean(xs):\\n    return sum(xs) / len(xs)\\n\\n\\ndef main():\\n    mismatches = 0\\n    checks = 0\\n    for seed in range(120):\\n        # 确定性伪随机序列，长度有奇有偶\\n        n = 6 + (seed * 7) % 30\\n        xs = [((seed * 31 + i * 17) % 89) + (i % 4) * 0.5 for i in range(n)]\\n        got = stats.median(xs)\\n        want = ref_median(xs)\\n        checks += 1\\n        if got != want:\\n            mismatches += 1\\n            print(f\\\"[MISMATCH] batch={seed:03d} len={n} \\\"\\n                  f\\\"median got={got!r} want={want!r} input={xs!r}\\\")\\n        got_mean = stats.mean(xs)\\n        want_mean = ref_mean(xs)\\n        checks += 1\\n        if abs(got_mean - want_mean) > 1e-9:\\n            mismatches += 1\\n            print(f\\\"[MISMATCH] batch={seed:03d} mean got={got_mean!r} \\\"\\n                  f\\\"want={want_mean!r}\\\")\\n        summary = stats.batch_summary([xs])[0]\\n        checks += 1\\n        if summary[1] != want:\\n            mismatches += 1\\n            print(f\\\"[MISMATCH] batch={seed:03d} batch_summary median \\\"\\n                  f\\\"got={summary[1]!r} want={want!r}\\\")\\n    print(f\\\"\\\\n共 {checks} 项检查，{mismatches} 项不一致\\\")\\n    return 1 if mismatches else 0\\n\\n\\nif __name__ == \\\"__main__\\\":\\n    raise SystemExit(main())\\n\"}}\n\n{\"id\": 11, \"tool\": \"read\", \"path\": \"stats.py\", \"action\": {\"tool\": \"read\", \"path\": \"stats.py\"}, \"result\": {\"content\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"数据统计管线：基础统计量与批处理标准化。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\n\\ndef mean(xs):\\n    if not xs:\\n        raise ValueError(\\\"empty sequence\\\")\\n    return sum(xs) / len(xs)\\n\\n\\ndef median(xs):\\n    if not xs:\\n        raise ValueError(\\\"empty sequence\\\")\\n    s = sorted(xs)\\n    n = len(s)\\n    mid = n // 2\\n    if n % 2 == 1:\\n        return s[mid]\\n    return s[mid]\\n\\n\\ndef variance(xs):\\n    m = mean(xs)\\n    return sum((x - m) ** 2 for x in xs) / len(xs)\\n\\n\\ndef std(xs):\\n    return variance(xs) ** 0.5\\n\\n\\ndef zscores(xs):\\n    m = mean(xs)\\n    sd = std(xs)\\n    if sd == 0:\\n        return [0.0 for _ in xs]\\n    return [(x - m) / sd for x in xs]\\n\\n\\ndef moving_average(xs, k):\\n    if k <= 0:\\n        raise ValueError(\\\"window must be positive\\\")\\n    return [mean(xs[i:i + k]) for i in range(len(xs) - k + 1)]\\n\\n\\ndef robust_center(xs):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"抗离群点的中心估计：中位数。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    return median(xs)\\n\\n\\ndef trim_outliers(xs, z=2.0):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"去掉 |z 分数| 超过阈值的点，返回保留的元素。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    zs = zscores(xs)\\n    return [x for x, zv in zip(xs, zs) if abs(zv) <= z]\\n\\n\\ndef batch_summary(batches):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"对每个批次输出 (均值, 中位数, 标准差)。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    return [(mean(b), median(b), std(b)) for b in batches]\\n\"}}\n\n{\"id\": 10, \"tool\": \"invalid\", \"path\": \"\", \"action\": null, \"result\": {\"error\": \"Extra data: line 3 column 1 (char 35)\"}}\n\n{\"id\": 2, \"tool\": \"list\", \"path\": \"\", \"action\": {\"tool\": \"list\"}, \"result\": {\"files\": [\"run_checks.py\", \"stats.py\", \"test_stats_core.py\", \"test_stats_edges.py\", \"test_stats_pipeline.py\"]}}\n\n{\"id\": 1, \"tool\": \"plan\", \"path\": \"\", \"action\": {\"tool\": \"plan\", \"items\": [{\"title\": \"探索仓库并读取关键业务文件\", \"status\": \"doing\"}, {\"title\": \"运行基线 pytest 与 run_checks.py 保存失败输出\", \"status\": \"todo\"}, {\"title\": \"定位唯一根因并最小修复 stats.py\", \"status\": \"todo\"}, {\"title\": \"回归验证 pytest 与 run_checks.py 全绿\", \"status\": \"todo\"}]}, \"result\": {\"items\": [{\"title\": \"探索仓库并读取关键业务文件\", \"status\": \"doing\"}, {\"title\": \"运行基线 pytest 与 run_checks.py 保存失败输出\", \"status\": \"todo\"}, {\"title\": \"定位唯一根因并最小修复 stats.py\", \"status\": \"todo\"}, {\"title\": \"回归验证 pytest 与 run_checks.py 全绿\", \"status\": \"todo\"}]}}"}], "discarded_ids": []}
